<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <title>Platillos - Privacy Policy</title>
    <link href="/styles/terms-and-conditions.css" rel="stylesheet">
    {{> head}}
</head>
<body>
    <div class="terms-container">
        <h1 class="platillos-title">Platillos</h1>
        <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p>Last updated: July 8, 2025</p>

        <p>Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how Platillos collects, uses, shares, and protects your personal information when you use our platform. By using Platillos, you consent to the practices described below.</p>

        <h3>1. Information We Collect</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Account Information:</strong> When you register, we collect your name, email, phone number, address, date of birth, and password.</li>
            <li><strong>Content You Provide:</strong> We collect reviews, photos, and other content you post.</li>
            <li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> We collect information about how you use Platillos, including pages viewed, features used, and interactions with content.</li>
            <li><strong>Device and Log Data:</strong> We collect information about your device, browser, IP address, and log data when you access Platillos.</li>
            <li><strong>Location Data:</strong> With your consent, we may collect and use your location to show relevant dishes and restaurants near you.</li>
            <li><strong>Cookies and Tracking:</strong> We use cookies and similar technologies to enhance your experience, remember your preferences, and analyze usage.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>2. How We Use Your Information</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>To create and manage your account</li>
            <li>To provide, personalize, and improve our services</li>
            <li>To communicate with you about your account, updates, and marketing (if you opt in)</li>
            <li>To verify your identity and prevent fraud</li>
            <li>To analyze usage and improve the platform</li>
            <li>To comply with legal obligations</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>3. How We Share Your Information</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>With other users, when you post reviews or content</li>
            <li>With service providers who help us operate Platillos (e.g., hosting, analytics, messaging)</li>
            <li>With law enforcement or authorities if required by law or to protect our rights and users</li>
            <li>In connection with a business transfer, such as a merger or acquisition</li>
            <li>With your consent or at your direction</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>4. Your Choices and Rights</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>You can update your account information at any time in your profile settings</li>
            <li>You can opt out of marketing communications by following the unsubscribe instructions or updating your preferences</li>
            <li>You can request deletion of your account and personal data by contacting us at <a href="mailto:support@platillos.com">support@platillos.com</a></li>
            <li>You can control cookies through your browser settings</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>5. Data Security</h3>
        <p>We use industry-standard security measures to protect your information. However, no method of transmission or storage is 100% secure. We encourage you to use strong passwords and keep your credentials confidential.</p>

        <h3>6. Children's Privacy</h3>
        <p>Platillos is not intended for children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If we learn that we have collected such information, we will delete it promptly.</p>

        <h3>7. International Users</h3>
        <p>Platillos is based in the United States. If you access Platillos from outside the U.S., you consent to the transfer and processing of your information in the U.S. and other countries where we operate.</p>

        <h3>8. Changes to This Policy</h3>
        <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify users of significant changes. Continued use of Platillos after changes means you accept the updated policy.</p>

        <h3>9. Contact Us</h3>
        <p>If you have any questions or requests regarding this Privacy Policy or your data, please contact us at <a href="mailto:support@platillos.com">support@platillos.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
